---
description: Investigate the exact installed package and explain its review scope without changing source.
args:
  goal: string
returns: InstalledPackageInvestigation
---
Use discoverPackage and inspectPackage to join the actual assignment, deployed worker declaration and current/baseline manifest. Use decidePackage to examine those actual native facts and explain the review's current authority. Keep an inspect-only, foreign, stale or withdrawn scope explicit. Return the exact assignment, observation and finding for the caller's decision; this investigation does not restore source or execute a suite.
